aux_grating
#
# This file contains the lookup tables calibrating grating cell tilt
# angle into motor steps. A lookup table is used because the calibration
# can be non-linear and include a sinusoidal element. Cell numbers 1,2,3,4
# are the same as cells A,B,C,D. 65 degrees is the zero order reflection
# angle.
#

# Grating A translation table (based on Marc Dubbeldam's report)
# NOTE: These figures are based on Marc's orientation A measurement
# corrected using the offset measured by Rick Murowinski on 24 May 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 28 June 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 13 Feb 2001
# Cell  Tilt    Steps

1   0.0000000       0
1   7.784         882.5
1  26.049        2810.5
1  40.222        4306.5
1  52.916        5646.5
1  65.000        6922
1  77.088        8198
1  89.750        9534.5

